Generic single-database configuration.

## 1. Initialiser alembic pour telegram

bash
cd /home/barribar/Projects/AI/barribar-mini-rag/src/models/db_schemes/telegram

alembic init alembic
```

Ça va créer automatiquement :
```
telegram/
├── alembic/
│   ├── versions/        ← tes migrations
│   ├── env.py           ← config de connexion
│   ├── script.py.mako   ← template (le fichier manquant !)
│   └── README
└── alembic.ini          ← config principale

## 2. Configurer alembic.ini
    inisqlalchemy.url = postgresql://postgres:MOT_DE_PASSE@localhost:5432/telegramfile
    sqlalchemy.url = postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5400/telegramfile

## 3. Configurer env.py

from models.all_telegram_maktaba_fr import AllTelegramMaktabaFr
from models.all_telegram_kotob_fr import AllTelegramKotobFr
from telegram_base import TelegramSQLAlchemyBase

target_metadata = TelegramSQLAlchemyBase.metadata

## 4. Relancer la migration
bash
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "Add Telegram Tables"
alembic upgrade head